 "findings": [
  "VERDICT REJECT (round 2). Packet-caused lost rejections vs the merged base b0fb43c3e: cr2_seq_chr30_rsp_line and cr2_seq_raw_rs_rsp_line (Java exit 200, syntax error + XML crash page; base rejects; tip silently drops the line). Cause: DIRECTIVE_PLACEHOLDER is the in-band string \"\\x1ERSP\" (preprocess/mod.rs:3833), cleared at :109 and skipped by the post-TIM join at :3859; a user line `%chr(30)RSP` or raw U+001E+RSP equals it. rejection_contract.py reports both as introduced_losses.",
  "Residue 3 only half ported: after UmlSource#loadInternal joins a pending tail into the end line, Java's PSystemCommandFactory#finalizeDiagram returns the empty-diagram (Welcome) page when getTotalLineCount()==2 (PSystemCommandFactory.java:123). BY: cr2_seq_depth2_tail_then_end, cr2_seq_tail_then_indented_end, cr2_seq_chr92_tail_then_end are Java Welcome and merged-base Welcome but tip renders a message (uncounted by the classifier, which treats Welcome as nonpositive-accepted); cr2_seq_tail_then_backslash_end is a lost rejection vs 93bf53e18 for the same reason.",
  "New valid-input error vs the merged base: r2_component_include_tail_then_variable (BW; Java one DESCRIPTION link). Exposed by the correct placeholder pass-over; the joined link with an arrow in its label is misrouted to sequence at every strict build (control). Root cause T14.21; needs T14.21 or an owner exception.",
  "pipe_single_diagram is faithful to Pipe.java 180-224 for end recognition: expectedEnd via whole-line matches() (named start / trailing space -> @end, exact start -> @enduml, @endumlx prefix), CRLF, nested start in a continued line, content after the end: all match Java (BY + BW 8/9). Unported (T14.26): prepend, pre-start discard (cr2_seq_pre_start_backslash_text errors since 93bf53e18), @@@format.",
  "Empty/whitespace stdin: Java exit 50 (ERROR_50_NO_FILE_FOUND), empty stdout/stderr; tip exit 1, empty stdout, stderr 'No valid @start/@end found'; earlier builds exit 0 with a 4,554-byte SVG. Correct rejection (6 cases incl. retained checker_092_empty); exit code and stderr differ.",
  "split_blocks: 0 SVG byte changes on 12,550 goldens vs the merged base; ast/yaml differences on dot/* and sprites/sprite_multiple are run-to-run nondeterminism at both builds. Plain nested @start mismatches at every build (BlockUmlBuilder resets current; Rust counts depth): pre-existing.",
  "Wrapped include files: Java runs ReadFilterMergeLines on the included file (DiagramDetector.java:71-99), so a tail joins the included @enduml; Rust does not (all builds).",
  "Gates: lib 1,510/0; pipe_mode 13; no-oracle 11,181/11,251 and golden_pairs 754 failures, names byte-identical to 9834a7194; parity_perturbations 0 new, 1 fixed; harness_guards frozen-item guards pass, decimal ratchet and record guard identical to the merged base. Frozen paths unchanged b0fb43c3e..e3aa1c6b4; account precedes code; no fixture-keyed logic."
